      "quiz_68_2_q": "What forms clouds?",
      "quiz_68_3_fb1": "Lakes contribute a tiny fraction of global evaporation compared to the vast surface area of the oceans.",
      "quiz_68_3_fb2": "Rivers represent a tiny portion of global surface water and account for very little evaporation.",
      "quiz_68_3_fb4": "Soil moisture evaporation is limited by capillary action and plant coverage.",
