      "quiz_68_5_opt3": "25%",
      "quiz_68_5_opt4": "50%",
      "quiz_68_5_q": "How much of Earth's water is freshwater?",
      "quiz_68_6_fb1": "Clouds are made of condensed vapor. Stomata are microscopic pores in plant epidermal layers.",
      "quiz_68_6_fb3": "Subsurface channels are aquifers. Stomata are biological valves regulating leaf transpiration.",
