      "tai_tt_tcg_tcb_astronomers_time_scales": "TAI, TT, TCG, TCB — astronomers' time scales",
      "target_is_larger_than_your_field_of_vi": "⚠️ Target is larger than your field of view. ",
      "target_is_small_relative_to_atmospheri": "⚠️ Target is small relative to atmospheric seeing. ",
