      "in_positive_reinforcement_a_consequenc": "In positive reinforcement, a consequence is ADDED after a behavior to INCREASE the likelihood of that behavior occurring again. Your job: click \"Deliver Food\" immediately after the mouse presses the lever. Reinforce 10 lever presses!",
