      "putting_named_real_autistic_adults_ins": " Putting named real autistic adults inside a tool whose central image is a Skinner box would be exactly what the disability community has documented as harmful. The tool you want includes Ari Ne'eman, Temple Grandin, Damian Milton, Henny Kupferstein, Kassiane Asasumasu, Mel Baggs, Lydia X. Z. Brown, and Patty Berne — with documented quotes, context, and a curated reading list.",
