      "restraint_physical_holding_that_restri": "Restraint = physical holding that restricts a student's freedom of movement. Three types: physical (staff hands on student), mechanical (devices that restrict — almost never appropriate in schools), chemical (medication used for behavioral control rather than treatment — never appropriate without prescription).",
