      "shaping_uses_successive_approximations": "Shaping uses successive approximations. The mouse won't spin on its own! Follow this 3-step sequence: (1) Reinforce \"Turning Right\" (↪️) to increase turning. (2) Once turns are frequent, wait for \"Half-Turn\" (↩️↪️) and reinforce those. (3) Finally, wait for full \"Spinning\" (🌀) and reinforce! Shape 5 complete spins through 3 stages of approximation!",
