      "in_reality_fruit_bats_locate_ripe_frui": "In reality, fruit bats locate ripe fruit primarily through smell. Ripe mangoes, figs, and guavas emit strong volatile compounds that bats can detect from hundreds of meters away.",
      "in_space_no_one_can_hear_you_scream_li": "In space, no one can hear you scream — literally. Sound requires a medium (air, water, solid) to travel through. The vacuum of space is perfectly silent.",
