      "when_could_ketogenic_help_or_harm_cons": "When could ketogenic help or harm? Consider: ketogenic-diet therapy for refractory epilepsy is well-established (decades of RCTs); nutrient gaps, hypoglycemia risk on diabetes meds, social/sustainability cost, and contested questions about long-term kidney/cardiovascular impact are all open. (For CKD specifically, high-protein patterns are the more-supported concern; isolated ketosis-vs-CKD evidence is mixed.)",
