      "briar_press_maintains_a_directory_of_w": "Briar Press maintains a directory of working letterpress shops worldwide. Many offer workshops. In Maine: try AS220 Industries (Providence, drivable) or look up Down East letterpress practitioners.",
      "briar_press_type_casting_glossary": "Briar Press — Type-casting glossary",
