      "3_for_part_c_practice_with_the_actual_": "3. For Part C: practice with the actual code book you'll bring. Tab key sections. Time yourself looking up references.",
      "3_machine_welds_the_joint_while_operat": "3. Machine welds the joint while operator observes (sometimes a screen showing weld pool). Operator can intervene if needed.",
